    "outer cathode (−) electrode region in the annular compartment and labeled 'Cathode (−)'",
    "external voltage source box at lower right labeled 'Voltage source'",
    "black electrical wires connecting voltage source to anode and cathode",
    "cylindrical iron screen surrounding the anode compartment, shown as a curved mesh and labeled 'Iron screen'",
    "central green-tinted chlorine collector tube rising above the anode",
    "upward arrow inside the chlorine collector tube",
    "horizontal upper outlet pipe labeled 'Cl2 outlet'",
