    "right-side outlet pipe labeled 'Na outlet'",
    "animated Na+ ion particles in molten salt moving toward the cathode region",
    "animated Cl− ion particles in molten salt moving toward the central anode",
    "animated Cl2 gas bubbles rising through the central collector tube",
